# {{ng|used to attribute to the known object a characteristic that helps one know more about the topic; may optionally be followed by {{m|pl|jest}}}} {{+obj|pl|nom}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Janek '''to''' mój brat.|Janek '''is''' my brother.}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Górnicy '''to''' jest takie specyficzne społeczeństwo.|Miners '''are''' such a peculiar society.}}
# {{ng|used to juxtapose elements that are equivalent}}
#: {{uxi|pl|[[chcieć to móc|Chcieć '''to''' móc]].|[[where there's a will, there's a way|Where there's a will there's a way]].|lit=To want '''is''' to be able to.}}
#: {{uxi|pl|[[ciekawość to pierwszy stopień do piekła|Ciekawość '''to''' pierwszy stopień do piekła]].|[[curiosity killed the cat|Curiosity killed the cat]].|lit=Curiosity '''is''' the first step to hell.}}
# {{ng|used to indicate that the subject of the conversation has peculiarities which are familiar to the interlocutors, so that nothing else needs to be said about it in order to understand the topic}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Nasze straty są minimalne, ale bez śmierci się nie obejdzie. Wojna '''to''' wojna.|Our losses are minimal but some casualties are inevitable. War '''is''' war.}}
#: {{uxi|pl|No, ale rozkaz '''to''' rozkaz. Nie mnie podważać.|Well, but an order '''is''' an order. Not for me to question.}}
# [[in that case]], [[then]] {{ng|(used in if-constructions)}}
#: {{cot|pl|jeśli}}
#: {{uxi|pl|„Wiem, co chcę zrobić.” „'''To''' to zrób”.|“I know what I want to do.” “'''Then''' do it.”}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Jeśli to zrobisz, '''to''' daj mi znać.|If you do this, '''then''' let me know.}}
#: {{uxi|pl|„Jeżeli zbuduję sobie kiedyś własny dom, '''to''' właśnie taki” – myślałam.|“If I ever build my own house one day, '''this''' is the one,” I thought.}}

