===Particle===
{{head|pl|particle}}

# {{ng|used to indicate what one is talking about}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Parę razy mi się udało. Z jedną '''to''' nawet bardzo.|I have succeeded a couple of times. With one '''it''' was even very successful.}}
# {{ng|used to indicate what can be said about the topic, in contrast to all that cannot be said about it}}
#: {{uxi|pl|W tych ścianach '''to''' ona była królową i musiała mieć królewskie wejście.|Within these walls, '''it''' was her '''who''' was the queen and had to have a royal entrance.}}
# [[so]] {{ng|(used after a pause for thought to introduce a new topic, question, or story, or a new thought or question in continuation of an existing topic)}}
#: {{syn|pl|a}}
#: {{uxi|pl|No '''to''' kiedy zaczynamy?|'''So''' when are we starting?}}
#: {{uxi|pl|OK, '''to''' do zobaczenia.|OK, see you '''then'''.}}
# {{ng|used to indicate that the topic in the relevant question refers to a known set of elements from which a choice has to be made}}
#: {{syn|pl|też}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Od kiedy '''to''' morderstwo jest takim ewenementem?|'''Since''' when is murder such a rarity?}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Komu '''to''' przypadło dzisiaj kucharzowanie?|Who '''is''' cooking today?}}
# {{ng|used to express surprise that something is indeed like that as the speaker did not think it could really be so}}
#: {{syn|pl|ale|co za|jaki}}
#: {{uxi|pl|A '''to''' zdolniacha z wuja!|Uncle '''really''' is gifted!}}
#: {{uxi|pl|No, '''tośmy''' wczoraj mieli niezły bal!|Well, we had '''quite''' a party yesterday!}}
# {{lb|pl|literary}} {{ng|used to indicate that the topic refers to a known object, mentioned in the preceding statement}}
#: {{uxi|pl|O Czechosłowacji po roku 1968 dochodziły do nas ponure wiadomości, dlatego '''to''' starałem się przejechać ten kraj jak najszybciej mimo zmęczenia.|There was grim news about Czechoslovakia after 1968, '''which is''' why I tried to cross the country as quickly as possible despite my fatigue.}}
# {{lb|pl|colloquial}} {{ng|used to indicate that what someone has said about the topic is a fait accompli and should no longer be discussed}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Spróbuj zaakceptować jego wady. Nikt nie jest kryształowy. Pali '''to''' pali, widziały gały co brały.|Try to accept his flaws. No one is perfect. '''OK''', he smokes, '''so what? Big deal''', you should've thought about it earlier.}}

