==Vietnamese==

===Etymology===
Compare {{cog|th|โต}}, {{cog|lo|ໂຕ}}, {{cog|khb|ᦷᦎ}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-pron}}

===Adjective===
{{vi-adj|[[蘇]], [[𡚢]], [[𫰅]], [[𡚡]]}}

# [[big]], [[large]]
#: {{ant|vi|nhỏ|bé}}
# [[great]], [[considerable]]
# [[loud]]

====Usage notes====
* In many situations, this word and {{m|vi|lớn}} are interchangeable:
*: {{uxi|vi|nhà '''to''' mà chẳng ai ở|a big house where no one lives in}}
*: {{uxi|vi|căn nhà '''lớn''' trên đỉnh đồi|a big house on top of the hill}}
* However, for body parts, it seems like only ''to'' is used:
*: {{uxi|vi|tai '''to'''|big ears}}

====See also====
* {{l|vi|lớn}}; {{l|vi|bự}}
